{"id":"b38c6122dd933fec","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-index-complete.md","title":"常用索引集分类汇总","display":"thm-index-complete — 常用索引集分类汇总","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-index-complete","aliases":["20-thm-index-complete"],"display":"thm-index-complete — 常用索引集分类汇总","chapter":"4","section":"4.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.3.2；Theorems 4.3.3, 4.3.5；Corollary 4.3.6","source_pdf_pages":[122,123,124,125],"source_printed_pages":[86,87,88,89],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-fin-complexity]]","[[20-thm-inf-complexity]]","[[20-thm-tot-complexity]]","[[20-thm-cof-complexity]]","[[20-thm-rec-complexity]]","[[20-df-cof]]","[[20-df-fin]]","[[20-df-inf]]","[[20-df-totex]]","[[20-df-rec-index]]","[[20-df-sigma-complete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-index-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-index-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-index-complete — 常用索引集分类汇总"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.3.2；Theorems 4.3.3, 4.3.5；Corollary 4.3.6"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>122</span><span>123</span><span>124</span><span>125</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>86</span><span>87</span><span>88</span><span>89</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b297c57a51d3204\" href=\"?note=5b297c57a51d3204\" title=\"20-thm-fin-complexity\">20-thm-fin-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14c630355ef04ac5\" href=\"?note=14c630355ef04ac5\" title=\"20-thm-inf-complexity\">20-thm-inf-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"72b91474745d70ea\" href=\"?note=72b91474745d70ea\" title=\"20-thm-tot-complexity\">20-thm-tot-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e47661fa15be194\" href=\"?note=1e47661fa15be194\" title=\"20-thm-cof-complexity\">20-thm-cof-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a2416b6547fce789\" href=\"?note=a2416b6547fce789\" title=\"20-thm-rec-complexity\">20-thm-rec-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ddc81bc510c82f3e\" href=\"?note=ddc81bc510c82f3e\" title=\"20-df-cof\">20-df-cof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"551febe7ebb4dbc6\" href=\"?note=551febe7ebb4dbc6\" title=\"20-df-fin\">20-df-fin</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"574494b7c7eef96a\" href=\"?note=574494b7c7eef96a\" title=\"20-df-inf\">20-df-inf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f4b3a00f06ef7edb\" href=\"?note=f4b3a00f06ef7edb\" title=\"20-df-totex\">20-df-totex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"481242259f6605e4\" href=\"?note=481242259f6605e4\" title=\"20-df-rec-index\">20-df-rec-index</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>完全性均指普通多一归约。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cof}=\\{e:|\\omega\\setminus W_e|&lt;\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cof}=\\{e:|\\omega\\setminus W_e|&lt;\\omega\\}\\)</span> 是索引集合，见 cof。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fin}=\\{e:|W_e|&lt;\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fin}=\\{e:|W_e|&lt;\\omega\\}\\)</span> 是索引集合，见 fin。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inf}=\\{e:|W_e|=\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Inf}=\\{e:|W_e|=\\omega\\}\\)</span> 是索引集合，见 inf。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tot}=\\{e:\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tot}=\\{e:\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\omega\\}\\)</span> 是索引集合，见 totex。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}=\\{e:W_e\\in\\mathcal R\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}=\\{e:W_e\\in\\mathcal R\\}\\)</span> 为可计算域集的指标集合。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"5b297c57a51d3204\" href=\"?note=5b297c57a51d3204\" title=\"20-thm-fin-complexity\">20-thm-fin-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"14c630355ef04ac5\" href=\"?note=14c630355ef04ac5\" title=\"20-thm-inf-complexity\">20-thm-inf-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"72b91474745d70ea\" href=\"?note=72b91474745d70ea\" title=\"20-thm-tot-complexity\">20-thm-tot-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"1e47661fa15be194\" href=\"?note=1e47661fa15be194\" title=\"20-thm-cof-complexity\">20-thm-cof-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"a2416b6547fce789\" href=\"?note=a2416b6547fce789\" title=\"20-thm-rec-complexity\">20-thm-rec-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"ddc81bc510c82f3e\" href=\"?note=ddc81bc510c82f3e\" title=\"20-df-cof\">20-df-cof</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"551febe7ebb4dbc6\" href=\"?note=551febe7ebb4dbc6\" title=\"20-df-fin\">20-df-fin</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"574494b7c7eef96a\" href=\"?note=574494b7c7eef96a\" title=\"20-df-inf\">20-df-inf</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"f4b3a00f06ef7edb\" href=\"?note=f4b3a00f06ef7edb\" title=\"20-df-totex\">20-df-totex</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"481242259f6605e4\" href=\"?note=481242259f6605e4\" title=\"20-df-rec-index\">20-df-rec-index</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}index\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Fin},\\Sigma^0_2),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Inf},\\Pi^0_2),\\quad\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Tot},\\Pi^0_2),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Cof},\\Sigma^0_3),\\quad\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Rec},\\Sigma^0_3).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}index\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Fin},\\Sigma^0_2),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Inf},\\Pi^0_2),\\quad\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Tot},\\Pi^0_2),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Cof},\\Sigma^0_3),\\quad\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Rec},\\Sigma^0_3).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Tot 和 Inf 的正规形程序、Fin 的补集归约、Cof 的踢标记构造，以及 Rec 的肯定余有限／否定编码 K 构造，已在所列直接上游逐项展开。各归约可用标准指标 padding 单射化，因此本汇总除多一完全性外实际也具有原书的一一困难性。Cpl 的困难性不在此被混写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_3\">\\(\\Pi_3\\)</span> 完全性；其精确角色见二列编码原子。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 86–89 / PDF 122–125。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-fin-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"5b297c57a51d3204","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-fin-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-inf-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"14c630355ef04ac